// wording matches what people see in every other app (Cal AI shows the same
// list through Didomi). Copy lives in i18n/locales/<lang>/consent.json under
// `purposes.<id>`, `features.<id>` and `partners.<id>`.
//
// Copied into cal-clark-landing/src/lib/consent/ by `npm run consent:sync` —
// the landing is a separate git repo and cannot import through this app's
// tsconfig paths. Edit here, then run the sync. The server keeps its own
// slice (ids + required flags) in server/src/consent/catalog.ts by hand.

